// Description: Detects creation of scheduled tasks excluding system-level activity, indicating potential persistence or malicious automation
// Data Source: DeviceEvents
// Severity: High (Persistence / Post-Compromise)
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1053.005
// False Positives: Software installers, IT automation tools, system maintenance scripts, enterprise deployment systems

DeviceEvents 
| where ActionType == "ScheduledTaskCreated"
  and InitiatingProcessAccountSid != "S-1-5-18"
